<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tpl_app_lang">TplAppLang</link></para>

<para>This class provides methods to generate and manage language-related menu items and actions within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It includes functionalities for creating language switch actions and processing language menus. </para>
