<anchor xml:id="_class_tpl_app_lang_1a77eae1d27d7e80e813ed938bdd90e01f"/><section>
    <title>getActionSwitchLang()</title>
<indexterm><primary>getActionSwitchLang</primary><secondary>TplAppLang</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm><primary>TplAppLang</primary><secondary>getActionSwitchLang</secondary></indexterm>
<para><computeroutput>getActionSwitchLang ( $lang)<computeroutput>[static]</computeroutput></computeroutput></para>
<para>Generates the action to switch the application language.</para>

<para>This method creates the action string for switching the application language. It includes commands to reload the application after the language switch. The action string is used to define what happens when the switch language action is triggered.</para>

